  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So the extrema of the function is at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Plotting the graph we get&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5737abf4-b453-48bf-9c52-7d113db354b0-image.png\" style=\"width: 239px; height: 170px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>And at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> will&nbsp;cut x-axis at two points,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Number of real roots of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
